# Guest root filesystem — a BUILD ARTIFACT, not source. 512 MiB, rebuilt by
# ./build-rootfs.sh from rootfs/ + packages/, and distributed to users from
# R2 (cloudflare/upload-rootfs.sh), not from git. It was tracked until
# 2026-08; 122 versions of it in the unpushed history made the branch
# impossible to push (GitHub rejects blobs over 100 MB).
